Generate structured query parameters for this request:

User Query: "{{ user_input }}"
Current Date: {{ current_date }}

AVAILABLE FILTERS:
- date_from: Start date (YYYY-MM-DD format)
- date_to: End date (YYYY-MM-DD format)  
- direction: "expense" or "income"
- category_id: Exact UUID from categories list below
- amount_min: Minimum amount (number)
- amount_max: Maximum amount (number)
- sort: "entry_date.desc" (default), "entry_date.asc", "amount_cents.desc", "amount_cents.asc", or "created_at.desc"
- limit: Number of results to return (default: 10, max: 10)
- offset: Number of results to skip (default: 0)
- q: Text search in description (only if user asks for text search)

CRITICAL VALIDATION RULES:
- For "this month" queries: use date_from = first day of current month
- For "last week" queries: use date_from = 7 days ago, date_to = today
- For "recent" queries: use date_from = 7 days ago
- Use exact category_id from the list below, not category names
- Do NOT include 'q' parameter unless user explicitly asks for text search
- Include 'limit' only if user specifies a number of results, otherwise omit (defaults to 10)
- Include 'offset' only if user asks to skip results, otherwise omit (defaults to 0)
- Amount values (amount_min, amount_max) must be positive numbers
- Only use sort values: "entry_date.desc", "entry_date.asc", "amount_cents.desc", "amount_cents.asc", or "created_at.desc"

